# TKMeshVS), ApplicationFramework, and DataExchange are built; OpenGL/VTK
# visualization drivers and Draw are not. See occt.bzl for how the
# src/<Module>/<Toolkit>/<Package>/ layout is mapped onto cc_library targets.

